# Route: guide 30 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 49 to
# 50, 5 quests, 0.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Azshara): Valormok -> Shadowsong Shrine -> Haldarr Encampment ->
# Shadowsong Shrine -> Legashi Encampment -> Thalassian Base Camp -> Legashi
# Encampment -> The Shattered Strand -> Legashi Encampment.
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 5141
# Dragonscale Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

